# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*
# …exceto o template. Ele não carrega valor nenhum: é a checklist do que
# precisa existir na Vercel antes do primeiro deploy.
!.env.example

# claude code local settings (machine-specific). `settings.json` is ignored too:
# it accumulates a per-session permission allowlist full of one-off entries —
# specific commit SHAs, absolute paths, single commands — which is noise for
# everyone else, not project configuration.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.json

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# brand originals: the SVG/PNG/PDF cuts under docs/Logos-fogao_de_Ouro are
# versioned (they are the source of truth for public/brand), but the delivery
# zips and the EPS are ~7.5 MB of redundancy — same artwork, formats nothing in
# this project reads.
docs/Logos-fogao_de_Ouro/*.zip
docs/Logos-fogao_de_Ouro/EPS/

# Backups do banco. O repositorio e PUBLICO e os contatos trazem nome, e-mail,
# telefone e mensagem de quem escreveu pelo site — dado pessoal nao entra aqui.
# `snapshot.sql` e a excecao consciente: e o retrato do banco LOCAL de
# desenvolvimento, sem contato nenhum, e o SNAPSHOT.md depende dele.
prisma/backups/*
!prisma/backups/snapshot.sql
